      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TRAVIS INTENTION (2) hit the frame two on end before being rewarded with a deserved win last time, scoring at Ballarat over 450m (25.28). Can continue on his winning ways. WHITE MOCHA (1) missed the frame last time when seventh (34.54) at Sandown in a Grade 5 but not beaten far the start prior. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. DAINTREE GAV (3) doesn't show much early dash but winds into his races, hitting the line hard to place two back then came home strongly into third (26.16) in a Grade 4/5 at this track last time. Has a good record at this journey. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Leading chance. SOFT BEAUTY (7) was in the money last start despite a big quote and is likely to feature again.",
